- 'Coverage goals (W04) remain surfaced-not-enforced: verdict-changing coverage/execution
  enforcement is deliberately omitted because iteration 1 demonstrated such enforcement
  fails the current acceptance gate without a runner-provided multi-elaboration matrix'
validation:
- Re-run the 10-test regression through the worker flow (plain 'make UVM_TESTNAME=<test>')
